message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits; equal contributors, if any, are listed
  alphabetically by family name and marked with an asterisk (*) after their
  family names.
title: Pubgrade-Sidecar
abstract: >-
  Pubgrade-Sidecar runs next to the Kubernetes Deployments of a service and
  rolls them out to new image tags when Pubgrade, a publish-subscribe service
  for continuous delivery, notifies it of a new release. It reports the state
  of each delivery, and is deployed with its Helm chart on Kubernetes and
  OpenShift.
type: software
